    {"claim": "The one-in-a-thousand reading rate is a demonstrated market outcome, so voluntary readable consent has already failed the market test and deletion without replacement removes an accountability check with nothing to replace it.", "targets": ["AN-3"], "relationship": "extends"}
  ],
