    {"claim": "The FTC disgorgement precedents like Everalbum and Kurbo sit inside existing consumer-protection authority, unlike a novel AI filing regime under legal challenge.", "targets": ["AN-44"]},
    {"claim": "Courts may find that a false filing about your own data is not a concrete, court-recognized injury — I concede that one outright.", "targets": []},
    {"claim": "The trust survey says 79 percent of people globally use AI tools while 36 percent do not know it.", "targets": []}
